{"sourceUrl":"https://sph.csu.edu.cn/info/1172/5189.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:12.247626+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sph.csu.edu.cn/info/1172/5189.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，湘雅公共卫生学院决定举办</span>2026<span>年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日活动（以下简称开放日活动），现就开放日活动相关事项通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、活动宗旨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>开放日活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，活动期间学员有机会了解学院研究生招生政策，聆听知名学者讲座，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受学校良好的教学科研氛围。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>经教育部批准具有</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>资格高校的</span>202</span><span>7</span><span><span>届优秀本科生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>三、</span><span><span>申请专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学术型：</span>100400<span>公共卫生与预防医学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>专业型：</span>105300<span>公共卫生</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、报名时间与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名时间：</span>2026<span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span></span><span>- </span><span>7<span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名，登录</span><span>“</span><span>中南大学</span><span>2026</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日</span><span>”</span><span>网站报名，报名链接：</span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、活动</span></span><span><span>时间</span></span><span><span>与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办时间：</span>2026 <span>年 </span><span>7 </span><span>月 </span><span>19 </span><span>日 </span><span>- 7</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办方式：线下举办</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、资格审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2026 <span>年 </span><span>7 </span><span>月 </span><span>12 </span><span>日前学院完成全部报名材料资格审核工作，学生可登录报名系统查询申请状态；若状态显示 </span><span>“</span><span>申请信息院系审核合格</span><span>”</span><span>，即取得本次活动参与资格。审核通过的学生，请于 </span><span>7 </span><span>月 </span><span>14 </span><span>日前将下述材料按顺序扫描合并为一份 </span><span>PDF </span><span>文件，文件命名格式为 </span><span>“</span><span>姓名 </span><span>- </span><span>本科学校 </span><span>- </span><span>本科专业</span><span>”</span><span>，发送至邮箱：</span><span>13517495012@163.com</span><span>。材料清单如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>本人身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>网上报名《申请表》一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>个人自述：含个人简历、参加本次</span></span><span><span>开放日活动</span></span><span><span>的原因、目的和期望等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（</span></span><span><span>由</span></span><span><span>所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>五</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>六</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>七</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>八</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>本科就读学校专家（副教授及其以上职称）推荐表</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、具体活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2026 <span>年 </span><span>7 </span><span>月 </span><span>19 </span><span>日下午参会人员报到；</span><span>7 </span><span>月 </span><span>20 </span><span>日上午学院宣讲、参观校园与学院，下午学术讲座、师生面对面交流。详细日程安排另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、其他说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加</span></span><span><span>开放日活动</span></span><span><span>资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>期间，请注意保证安全问题，如人身、财产、交通安全等，必须遵守中南大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>我院将为入选的外地学生提供开放日期间在长沙的食宿（注：学校或家庭所在地是长沙的学生原则上不安排住宿），往返交通费用自理。学生报到后要求全程参加开放日活动，擅自离开者，学院将不提供相关资助。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>九、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>李</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>0731-</span><span>89667220  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><span>13517495012@163.com</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：</span></span><span><span>湖南省长沙市岳麓区桐梓坡路</span>172<span>号</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湘雅公共卫生</span></span><span><span>学院研究生招生</span>QQ<span>群：</span></span><span>1048128980</span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sph.csu.edu.cn/__local/1/10/1B/A345D957CAFD6DA6DBE831BD8BA_C93F2859_1C63A.jpg\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学湘雅公共卫生学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"bd2647d1967ace8361a8ac021cc2d12c77709d357a268c7b7bee6243564f4e72","textLength":1312,"sourceSha256":"8bf8c8be1dfa00d169e7d83ddded3990db84f0efb86c7684fa49124579e442f7","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b7c9b737d293cf520a08","title":"2026年中南大学湘雅公共卫生学院关于举办2026年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:12.247626+00:00"}
